sel4-lean is distributed under two licenses.

1. Code derived from seL4's l4v verification project is licensed under
   GPL-2.0-only (LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt), the license of the l4v sources
   it is derived from. These files carry `SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only`
   and are listed in NOTICE.md:
     - lean/Sel4Lean/Spec/Gen/, lean/Sel4Lean/Exec/Gen/   (generated from l4v's Haskell spec
                                                            and Kernel_Config.thy)
     - hand ports of l4v theories: lean/Sel4Lean/Spec/{MachineOps, Platform,
       PSpaceStorable, PSpaceInstances, KernelInit, Intermediate, DesignOnly}.lean,
       lean/Sel4Lean/Abstract/, lean/Sel4Lean/Refine/,
       lean/Sel4Lean/Exec/{Stubs, ThreadStubs}.lean
     - artifacts/   (build and test outputs of l4v and of the files above)

2. Everything else (the translators and gates in tools/ and env/, the Lean monad,
   Hoare-logic, corres and tactic library, tests, scripts, notes and site) is
   licensed under BSD-2-Clause (LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt). Parts of the Lean
   library follow l4v's lib/ (Nondet_Monad, Nondet_VCG, Corres_UL), which is
   itself BSD-2-Clause.

seL4 and l4v are copyright their respective authors (General Dynamics C4 Systems,
Data61/CSIRO, Proofcraft and contributors); see NOTICE.md.
